{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>יִנּוּב</b> — from the domain of תְּנוּבָה (produce). Its meaning: he gives the yield of wisdom. And נִיב שְׂפָתַיִם is like תְּבוּאַת שְׂפָתָיו יִשְׂבָּע (Proverbs 18:20). And similarly בֵּין אַחִים יַפְרִיא — he gives fruit. And לָשׁוֹן דֹּבְרוֹת תַהְפֻּכוֹת — שְׂפָתָיו תִּכָּרֵת (Proverbs 10:31 [sic])."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:08.567922783Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}